{"id":"bb495d7446e8fef8","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-supertruth.md","title":"超真理谓词","display":"df-supertruth — 超真理谓词","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-supertruth","aliases":["91-df-supertruth","91-df-supertruth-predicate"],"display":"df-supertruth — 超真理谓词","depends_on":["[[91-df-supervaluation]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-supertruth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-supertruth</span><span>91-df-supertruth-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-supertruth — 超真理谓词"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f012d0f8371bf9a\" href=\"?note=3f012d0f8371bf9a\" title=\"91-df-supervaluation\">91-df-supervaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-supertruth-—-超真理谓词-$T^+$\">df-supertruth — 超真理谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^+\">\\(T^+\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> (对象语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(v:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (部分评估)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\)</span> (保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 已确定值的经典精确化集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supertruth}\\vdash\nT_v^+\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\land\n\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supertruth}\\vdash\nT_v^+\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\land\n\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_v^+\">\\(T_v^+\\)</span>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的所有经典精确化中都为真的句子编码集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\">\\(\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\)</span>：所有保持已确定值的经典精确化</li>\n</ul>\n<p>超真理谓词的含义：\n超真不等于“在某一个强 Kleene 模型中值为真”。它要求句子在给定部分评估的每一个允许精确化中都为真。</p>\n<p>超真理与强Kleene模型的关系：\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L}_v\">\\(\\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L}_v\\)</span> 是相应超赋值评估，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_v^+\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L}_v(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_v^+\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L}_v(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>超真理与固定点：\n固定点可提供部分评估 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>；在此基础上才能对其精确化定义超真。超真概念本身不等同于最小或最大固定点的真外延。</p>\n<p>超真理在VF理论中的应用：\nVF 的预期语义与超赋值思想相关；对象理论中的可证等价必须从 VF 的具体公理推出，不能由上述元语义定义直接断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-supertruth-—-超真理谓词-$T^+$","text":"df-supertruth — 超真理谓词 $T^+$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-supervaluation","status":"resolved","id":"3f012d0f8371bf9a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-supervaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\ne\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supertruth}\\vdash\nT_v^+\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\land\n\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T_v^+","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L}_v","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_v^+\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L}_v(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t.","display":true},{"tex":"v","display":false}],"bytes":1768,"backlinks":[{"id":"0a986179bb85417f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[